OL,3,AOne dead, 102 rescued from Indonesian
OL,4,Aferry that went missing in Java Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has died and 102 have been
OL,7,Frescued from a stricken Indonesian
OL,8,Fpassenger ferry in the Java Sea, an
OL,9,Fofficial said.
OL,11,FA search and rescue operation was
OL,12,Flaunched after contact was lost with
OL,13,Fthe Virgo Transport 8 ship, which was
OL,14,Fcarrying 243 people, as it encountered
OL,15,Fbad weather, Indonesia's search and
OL,16,Frescue agency said.
OL,18,FThe search for the remaining passengers
OL,19,Fis ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
